                                "sense_id": "4108a927-2b75-3fc6-84be-e94e188d6326",
                                "text": "Malathion, another of the organic phosphates, is almost as familiar to the public as DDT, being widely used by gardeners, in household insecticides, in mosquito spraying and in such blanket attacks on insects as the spraying of nearly a million acres of Florida communities for the Mediterranean fruit fly."
